# FreeLinX: greetd-greeter PAM service.
# Used by greetd to launch the greeter (tuigreet) as the 'greeter' user.
# The greeter does not authenticate - it merely presents the login UI, so
# everything is permissive here.  Real authentication happens through the
# 'greetd' service (pam_unix shadow auth) once the user submits credentials.
auth required pam_permit.so
account required pam_permit.so
session required pam_permit.so